# iOS Accessibility Coverage Tracker

Tracks which view surfaces are instrumented with `.ax(_:)` identifiers + `Trace.viewAppear` + `Trace.action` events. When a flow's coverage goes ✅ across all three columns, its paired `qa/smoke-<flow>.sh` script can drive permutation tests without coordinates or screenshots.

Legend: ✅ done · 🟡 partial (priority controls only) · ⬜ pending · ⊘ N/A (uninstrumentable, see notes)

