## How to update this tracker

When you instrument a view: flip the column emoji and add the smoke script name. When the smoke script lands: link it. When a flow goes 100%, surface that win in the commit message ("Customer CRUD coverage 100% — `smoke-customer-crud.sh` exercises 22 permutations").
